{"id":1350,"date":"2020-11-18T11:22:14","date_gmt":"2020-11-18T11:22:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=1350"},"modified":"2021-06-07T06:21:03","modified_gmt":"2021-06-07T06:21:03","slug":"detekce-fluorovanych-uhlovodiku-v-lyzarskem-vosku","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/detekce-fluorovanych-uhlovodiku-v-lyzarskem-vosku\/","title":{"rendered":"Detekce fluorovan\u00fdch uhlovod\u00edk\u016f v ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9m vosku"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1350\" class=\"elementor elementor-1350\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-93f893f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"93f893f\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ecf4cf6\" data-id=\"ecf4cf6\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65b97a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"65b97a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e1 federace (FIS) a Mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed biatlonov\u00e1 unie (IBU) zak\u00e1zaly do budoucna jak\u00e9koliv pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed fluorovan\u00e9ho vosku p\u0159i ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00fdch z\u00e1vodech. Infra\u010derven\u00e1 spektroskopie dok\u00e1\u017ee nejen velmi snadno a rychle detekovat fluorovan\u00e9 uhlovod\u00edky v ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9m vosku r\u016fzn\u00fdch v\u00fdrobc\u016f, ale i p\u0159\u00edmo na ly\u017e\u00edch p\u0159ed z\u00e1vodem a po z\u00e1vod\u011b! Ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9 vosky jsou obvykle komplexn\u00ed sm\u011bsi uhlovod\u00edk\u016f a fluorovan\u00fdch uhlovod\u00edk\u016f. Fluorovan\u00e9 ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9 vosky jsou velmi hydrofobn\u00ed, odpuzuj\u00ed vodu od spodn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1sti ly\u017e\u00ed, co\u017e umo\u017e\u0148uje lep\u0161\u00ed klouz\u00e1n\u00ed po sn\u011bhu. P\u0159esn\u00e9 slo\u017een\u00ed ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9ho vosku je v\u00fdrobcem z\u0159\u00eddka zve\u0159ej\u0148ov\u00e1no, ale v\u011bdeck\u00e9 studie zjistily vysok\u00e9 hladiny perfluorokarboxylov\u00fdch kyselin (PFCA), perfluoralkylsulfonov\u00fdch kyselin (PFSA) a fluorovan\u00fdch n-alkan\u016f (SFA). Typick\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edklady t\u011bchto slou\u010denin jsou nap\u0159. kyselina perfluoroktanov\u00e1 a kyselina perfluoroktansulfonov\u00e1. V posledn\u00edch letech je \u010dasto diskutov\u00e1n negativn\u00ed dopad fluorovan\u00e9ho ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9ho vosku, a to jak ve vztahu k\u00a0vn\u011bj\u0161\u00edmu \u017eivotn\u00edmu prost\u0159ed\u00ed, tak ve vztahu k lidsk\u00e9mu zdrav\u00ed. Z t\u011bchto d\u016fvod\u016f upozornily u\u017e v\u00a0roce 2019 Mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e1 federace (FIS) a Mezin\u00e1rodn\u00ed biatlonov\u00e1 unie (IBU), \u017ee pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1n\u00ed fluorovan\u00e9ho ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9ho vosku bude zak\u00e1z\u00e1no celosv\u011btov\u011b pro v\u0161echny ly\u017ea\u0159sk\u00e9 discipl\u00edny za\u010d\u00ednaj\u00edc\u00ed sez\u00f3nou 2020-21.<\/p><p>Infra\u010derven\u00e1 spektroskopie (FTIR ATR) je u\u017eivatelsky velmi jednoduch\u00e1 technika, kterou lze pou\u017e\u00edt nejen pro p\u0159\u00edmou anal\u00fdzu p\u0159\u00edtomnosti fluorovan\u00fdch l\u00e1tek v\u00a0pou\u017e\u00edvan\u00e9m vosku, ale i p\u0159\u00edmo aplikovat na m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed spekter povrchu ly\u017e\u00ed. Spektrum pou\u017eit\u00e9ho vosku je m\u011b\u0159iteln\u00e9 i po 30 km ly\u017eov\u00e1n\u00ed! Pou\u017e\u00edt lze bez probl\u00e9m\u016f p\u0159enosn\u00fd spektrometr\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is5\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nicolet iS5<\/a>, \u010di\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-summit\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nicolet Summit<\/a>, kter\u00e9 lze dodat i se specializovan\u00fdm n\u00e1razu odoln\u00fdm kufrem PeliCase. Pro v\u00edce informac\u00ed n\u00e1s nev\u00e1hejte kontaktovat.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-abb16c4 dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"abb16c4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"430\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/0c59ccac-1024x551.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1352\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/0c59ccac-1024x551.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/0c59ccac-300x161.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/0c59ccac-768x413.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/0c59ccac.jpg 1082w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-55fa8d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"55fa8d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Nicolet Summit PRO s diamantov\u00fd ATR n\u00e1stavcem<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>Elin-Melina Visur, Kim Wedum, Stig Pedersen-Bjergaard: Detection of fluorinated wax on cross-country skis by Attenuated Total Reflectance Fourier-Transform Infrared Spectrophotomet